  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Realm on a path climbs a fixed ladder from ordinary to supreme grandmaster. Quasi-master is the quasi step between ordinary and master. It is not one of the five main levels (ordinary, master, grandmaster, great grandmaster, and supreme grandmaster); those main levels are the rungs the quasi steps sit between.",
      "chapters": [
        687
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_attainment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Quasi-masters are geniuses or old, experienced Gu Masters.",
      "chapters": [
        687
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "who-reaches-it",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Quasi-master attainment is already rare. Young Gu Masters with outstanding aptitude or experienced old Gu Masters can reach it.",
      "chapters": [
        1326
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "who-reaches-it",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dream realms can raise a path into quasi-master without normal practice. Feng Jin Huang finds her refinement path realm at quasi-master after a dream realm journey, even though she had never practiced refinement path normally.",
      "chapters": [
        730
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-shortcut",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dream_realm",
        "char_feng_jin_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s wisdom path attainment likewise jumps from extremely ordinary to quasi-master after exploring Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        914
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-shortcut",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Refinement Path Convention, those who get through seven rounds are essentially quasi-masters at least, though some lucky entrants with lower attainment still appear among them.",
      "chapters": [
        838
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "convention-floor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_refinement_path_convention"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ordinary attainment is the level most Gu Masters reach in their lifetimes. Quasi-master sits above that lasting height, and most Gu Masters find it difficult to reach even this step no matter how much effort they put in.",
      "chapters": [
        1326
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "above-ordinary",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The full ladder is on Attainment. Neighboring steps include ordinary attainment and master attainment. Dao marks and how they relate to attainment are on Dao Marks and Attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "above-ordinary",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    }
